* Mixed devices: touchscreen selection and physical card insertion.
Goal: Complete a kiosk checkout
. Goal: Select payment method
.. Look at <card payment button>
.. Touch <card payment button>
. Goal: Insert card
.. Hands to payment terminal
.. Look at <card slot>
.. Grasp <payment card>
.. Touch <card slot>
. Goal: Confirm purchase
.. Hands to touchscreen
.. Look at <confirm button>
.. Touch <confirm button>
.. Verify purchase is complete
